  "citation": "Khalil M A K; Rasmussen R A (1993): Atmospheric Methane at Cape Meares, Oregon, U.S.A.: A High-Resolution Data Base for the Period 1979-1992. Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (USA). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/ATG.DB1007",
